# Word lock files
~$*

# The live estate and the local archive live OUTSIDE this repo (see code/env.sh),
# so nothing large should ever land here. These are belt-and-braces in case
# somebody changes GF_ESTATE to a path inside the repo.
*.safetensors
*.dump
*.bundle
*.tgz

# Everything in output/ IS the evidence and MUST be committed:
#   restore-test.log, immutability-test.log, rpo-rto-output.txt,
#   backup-*.log, reproducible-receipt-*.txt
# Do not add output/ to this file.
#
# The repo root .gitignore has a blanket "*.log" rule, which would silently drop
# output/restore-test.log - the transcript this project is actually graded on.
# This line puts it back. Do not remove it.
!output/*.log
